experience.description:
Mainstreaming Energy Efficiency through Business Innovation Support, a project funded by EU SWITCH-Asia program
Technology focus: Solar water heater, heat pump, VSD, EE light, energy management software, energy audit service, water saving device. Industry focus: Garment & Textile, Food processing, Hotel & Office building, Restaurant.

- Coordinated 10 national staff, 10 international & national experts, and 11 technology partners for the implementation of marketing & business development support services;  
- Developed and implemented studies on access to finance for EE; initiated the cooperation between 2 lease firms and 2 technology suppliers; worked with technical consultants to develop an environmental impact measurement study, business opportunities assessment on water saving device;
- Prepared energy audit based cost-benefit analyses, case studies and communication materials; coordinated green exhibition - workshop events (50% increased participation rate); designed an innovative concept of 'walk-in clinic' sales & marketing training courses and networking platforms for 150+ technology stakeholders; 
- Administered Finance & Operation: policy drafting, budgeting, and reporting; 
- Appointed to be the project representative at SWITCH-Asia Networking Kathmandu 2013 to share experiences with 100+ participants from 70+ projects across Asia.

